In this paper, we are interested in obtaining Calder\'on-Zygmund type regularity estimates in weighted Lebesgue spaces for equations of the form
\begin{equation}
\label{main}
 \left\{
 \begin{array}{ll}
u_t - \dv  \mathcal{A}(x,t,\nabla u) = \dv |{\bf f}|^{p-2} {\bf f}  & \text{in} \ \Omega \times (-T,T), \\
u = 0 & \text{on} \ \partial_p\lbr  \Omega \times (-T,T)\rbr,
 \end{array}
\right.
