see Section 7 in \cite{pinkus1999approximation}. The identity can be verified by observing that the outer neuron only gets activated if and only if all the inner neurons return one and this is the case if and only if $a_i \leq x_i \leq b_i$ for all $i=1,\ldots,d.$


