Then the AKS scheme deals with explicit solutions and Hamiltonian structures of the flows 
\begin{equation}\label{Tdot}
\dot{T}=\big[\,T,\pi_+(f(T))\,\big]=-\big[\,T,\pi_-(f(T))\,\big],
\end{equation}
with $\Ad$-covariant functions $f:\mbox{\boldmath$g$}\to \mbox{\boldmath$g$}$.


