\spp(ba) & =& b\spp(a)&\textrm{for all }a\in Q\text{ and }b\in Q_0\;.
\end{array}\]
If a support is stable then it is the unique support and it is given by
\[
\spp(a) = a1\wedge e = aa^*\wedge e\;.
\]
