\newline\textbf{Q5. Can conditional steering mitigate steering side effects while maintaining control efficacy?} We investigate whether adjusting the steering strength $\lambda$ based on the model's current activations can mitigate quality degradation without sacrificing control over the target property.
\newline\textbf{Q6. How do model scale and architecture impact steering?}
