A \define{two-sided F\o{}lner{} sequence} on a discrete countable group $G$ is any sequence $\Phi\colon N \mapsto \Phi_N$ of finite, non-empty subsets of $G$ satisfying
\begin{equation}
\label{eq_folner}
\lim_{N \to \infty} \frac{|(\Phi_N g)\, \triangle \, \Phi_N|}{|\Phi_N|}
